<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: demon attack-->
  <DemonAssault.label>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.label>
  <!--EN: Demon attack-->
  <DemonAssault.letterLabel>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: The end is nigh - rampaging demons are attacking your colony!\nLike a herald to impending doom, fire and ash have begun falling from the skies.\n\nThese infernal beings have an assortment of attacks and challenging tactics.\nHowever, demons are unable to remain in this realm for extended periods and will be force to return to their hellish plane in about 3 hours. Defeat or outlast this nightmare.\nThere is very little time to prepare.\n\nGood luck!-->
  <DemonAssault.letterText>一切都会终结!-一个狂暴的恶魔正在攻击你的殖民地！\n\n这个地狱生物有各种各样的攻击方式，而且他会使用充满挑战性的战术。\n火焰和灰烬将从天而降。\n但是，恶魔无法在这个殖民地中停留很长时间，将会被迫在大约3小时内返回他们的世界。击败他或熬过这场噩梦。\n没有多少时间准备了。\n\n祝你好运！</DemonAssault.letterText>
  <!--EN: mana sickness-->
  <Disease_ManaSickness.label>法力反噬</Disease_ManaSickness.label>
  <!--EN: Mana sickness-->
  <Disease_ManaSickness.letterLabel>法力反噬</Disease_ManaSickness.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: {0} has gotten sick from {1}.\n\nEnsure you have a medical bed and a doctor. Make sure that {2} gets proper treatment and spends as much time in bed as possible.  During this period {0} will be unable to gain mana.-->
  <Disease_ManaSickness.letterText>{0} 已经得病了 {1}.\n\n确保你有一个医疗用床和医生. 确保 {2} 得到适当的治疗和尽量在床上修养一段时间。在这期间 {0} 不会获得法力值。</Disease_ManaSickness.letterText>
  <!--EN: elemental assault-->
  <ElementalAssault.label>元素袭击</ElementalAssault.label>
  <!--EN: Elemental assault-->
  <ElementalAssault.letterLabel>元素袭击</ElementalAssault.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: Hostile elementals have created a breach into your world and are preparing to send assault teams through the rift!\n\nRifts cause mayhem in the atmosphere as energy leaks through the rift into your world. The following effects occur for each rift element:\n\nFire Rift: meteor showers and heat waves.\nEarth Rift: toxic fumes and causes animals to go berserk\nIce Rift: hailstorms and rapid decline in temperature\nAir Rift: lightning storms\n\nDestroy the rift to end this nightmare!-->
  <ElementalAssault.letterText>不怀好意的元素体们在你的世界打开了一道缺口并准备派遣袭击队伍通过这道缝隙。</ElementalAssault.letterText>
  <!--EN: mana drain-->
  <ManaDrain.label>法力流失</ManaDrain.label>
  <!--EN: Mana drain-->
  <ManaDrain.letterLabel>法力流失</ManaDrain.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment is shifting, causing an ebb in mana.\n\nAll creatures attuned with magical powers will slowly lose mana.\n\nCreatures may become physically ill if they have no mana remaining.-->
  <ManaDrain.letterText>行星的天象导致了魔法的逐渐衰落。所有与魔法力量协调的生物会缓慢地失去力量。</ManaDrain.letterText>
  <!--EN: mana surge-->
  <ManaSurge.label>法力涌动</ManaSurge.label>
  <!--EN: Mana surge-->
  <ManaSurge.letterLabel>法力涌动</ManaSurge.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment has shifted, causing a surge in mana.  All creatures attuned with magical powers will gain mana at an increased rate.-->
  <ManaSurge.letterText>行星的天象导致了魔力激增。所有与魔法力量协调的生物，法力会得到一定量的增长。</ManaSurge.letterText>
  <!--EN: mana storm-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.label>法力风暴</TM_ManaStorm.label>
  <!--EN: Mana storm-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.letterLabel>法力风暴</TM_ManaStorm.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: Chaotic forces are causing a dangerous mana tides.\n\nDuring a mana storm, attempts to use mana to realize magical intent external to the caster will harm the caster proportionally to the mana cost of the spell. This damage is applied before the spell incantation begins. Unformed use of mana and internal use of magic, such as the transfer of mana or dispelling an enchantment is unaffected. Magic circles or foci cannot be used during this event. While the mana storm is active, energy costs are halved and mana reduction limit is removed.-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.letterText>混乱的力量正在造成危险的法力风暴。\n\n在法力风暴期间，任何试图使用法力的行为将对施法者造成与法术法力消耗成正比的伤害。这施法前便会造成伤害。未成形魔法的使用和魔法的内部使用，如闪烁魔法或驱散附魔，不受影响。法力风暴时不能使用魔术阵或魔法中心。当法力风暴来临时，所有的能量消耗减半，法力的上限减少将会被移除。</TM_ManaStorm.letterText>
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.label>游荡的巫妖</WanderingLich.label>
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.letterLabel>巫妖的进攻开始了。</WanderingLich.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.-->
  <WanderingLich.letterText>一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。</WanderingLich.letterText>
</LanguageData>
